{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image featuring a black hat. For every remote in the scene, there exists a specific arrangement of items extending to its left: the remote is positioned to the left of the black hat, a lighter is located to the left of the remote, a watch is to the left of the lighter, and a pair of red glasses is to the left of the watch. Additionally, the black hat is visually larger than the red glasses.",
